{
  "esm": "1.3.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_cgrid_avg_cell",
    "description": "The face-to-cell average on the mom6_cgrid: the quarter-mean of the four surrounding face fields of a cell, avg_cell(i,j,k) = 0.25*(x_u(i,j,k) + x_u(i-1,j,k) + x_v(i,j,k) + x_v(i,j-1,k)), where x_u [i,j,k] carries the east-face field (x_u(i,j) the east face of cell (i,j), x_u(i-1,j) the east face of the west neighbor, i.e. the west face of cell (i,j)) and x_v [i,j,k] the north-face field (x_v(i,j) the north face of cell (i,j), x_v(i,j-1) the north face of the south neighbor, i.e. the south face of cell (i,j)). This is the MOM6 cell average of the KE_ARAKAWA kinetic energy: KE = 0.25*IareaT*((areaCu(I-1,j)u(I-1,j)^2 + areaCu(I,j)u(I,j)^2) + (areaCv(i,J-1)v(i,J-1)^2 + areaCv(i,J)v(i,J)^2)) of MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 gradKE :1249-1397, with x_u = areaCu*u^2 on the east faces and x_v = areaCv*v^2 on the north faces. SOLID-WALL BOUNDARIES: the west edge of cell i = 1 has NO west face (the domain wall, whose face flux is identically zero — the same wall convention as the sibling mom6_cgrid_div_x rule), so the i = 1 region DROPS the x_u(i-1,j) term of the average: avg_cell(1,j,k) = 0.25*(x_u(1,j,k) + x_v(1,j,k) + x_v(1,j-1,k)); the j = 1 region drops the x_v(i,j-1) term: avg_cell(i,1,k) = 0.25*(x_u(i,1,k) + x_u(i-1,1,k) + x_v(i,1,k)); and the (1,1) corner drops both terms: 0.25*(x_u(1,1,k) + x_v(1,1,k)). The rule is a named-op rule (esm-spec 9.6.8), applied once per consumer equation as mom6_cgrid_avg_cell(x_u, x_v); both params must be declared [i,j,k] fields (esm-spec 9.6.1 where clause).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:rule",
      "family:mom6_cgrid",
      "grid:mom6_cgrid",
      "op:avg",
      "order:0",
      "bc:wall",
      "axes:i,j,k"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Adcroft, A., et al. (2019). The GFDL global ocean and sea ice model OM4.0. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 11(10), 3167-3211.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2019MS001726"
      },
      {
        "citation": "MOM6 source: MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc gradKE :1249-1397, the KE_ARAKAWA cell sum; the face conventions of the mom6_cgrid grid.esm."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "mom6_cgrid_avg_cell": {
      "params": ["x_u", "x_v"],
      "match": {
        "op": "mom6_cgrid_avg_cell",
        "args": ["x_u", "x_v"]
      },
      "where": {
        "x_u": {
          "shape": ["i", "j", "k"]
        },
        "x_v": {
          "shape": ["i", "j", "k"]
        }
      },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [
            [2, "N_I"],
            [2, "N_J"],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ],
          [
            [1, 1],
            [2, "N_J"],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ],
          [
            [2, "N_I"],
            [1, 1],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ],
          [
            [1, 1],
            [1, 1],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["x_u", "x_v"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [2, "N_I"],
              "j": [2, "N_J"],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": 0.25,
                  "units": "1"
                },
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "+",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "index",
                          "args": ["x_u", "i", "j", "k"]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "index",
                          "args": ["x_u", { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "+",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "index",
                          "args": ["x_v", "i", "j", "k"]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "index",
                          "args": ["x_v", "i", { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["x_u", "x_v"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [1, 1],
              "j": [2, "N_J"],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": 0.25,
                  "units": "1"
                },
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_u", "i", "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_v", "i", "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_v", "i", { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["x_u", "x_v"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [2, "N_I"],
              "j": [1, 1],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": 0.25,
                  "units": "1"
                },
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_u", "i", "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_u", { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_v", "i", "j", "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["x_u", "x_v"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [1, 1],
              "j": [1, 1],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": 0.25,
                  "units": "1"
                },
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_u", "i", "j", "k"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["x_v", "i", "j", "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
